    <string name="pocketpaint_ora_message_dialog">Wannan tsarin yana tuna <b>layuka</b>. <b>Manhajojin da ke goyon bayan tsarin OpenRaster za su iya buɗe shi.</b></string>
    <string name="pocketpaint_catrobat_message_dialog">Tsarin hoto na Pocket Paint na kansa. Wannan tsarin yana tuna umarni da layuka.</string>
    <string name="permission_info_external_storage_text">Wannan manhaja tana buƙatar izinin da aka nema don ta yi aiki yadda ya kamata. Don ajiye hotuna a ma\'adanar gida, manhajar tana buƙatar damar karantawa da rubutawa a ciki.</string>
    <string name="permission_info_permanent_denial_text">Wannan manhaja tana buƙatar izinin da aka nema don ta yi aiki yadda ya kamata. Don ajiye hotuna a ma\'adanar gida, manhajar tana buƙatar damar karantawa da rubutawa a ciki. Tun da ka ƙi izinin da “Kada a sake tambaya”, je zuwa saitunan wayarka ka ba da izinin da ake buƙata idan kana son amfani da ayyukan da suka shafi hakan.</string>
    <string name="set_center_info_text">Taɓa allon don saita sabon wurin tsakiya.</string>
    <string name="transform_info_text">Ja gefuna zuwa sabon wurinsu, sannan taɓa alamar daidai don ƙara girma ko yanke yankin hoton.</string>
