    <string name="pocketpaint_about_title">Game da</string>
    <string name="pocketpaint_about_content">Pocket Paint ɗakin karatu ne na gyaran hoto wanda ke cikin aikin Catrobat.\n\nCatrobat harshen shirye-shirye ne na gani da tarin kayan aikin ƙirƙira don wayoyin hannu.\n\nLambar tushe ta Pocket Paint galibi tana ƙarƙashin lasisin %s.\nDon cikakken bayani game da lasisin, duba mahaɗin da ke ƙasa.</string>
